{"problem_id": "c6bdb8f1-88ce-42e3-9215-59517aa71f9e", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 15, "items": [{"at": "2026-08-27T10:11:42.815275+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции вида <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x+a}\"></span> .  Най­ди­те зна­че­ние <i>x</i>, при ко­то­ром <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=0{,}15\"></span>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p>Гра­фик функ­ции <i>f</i> по­лу­чен из гра­фи­ка <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\frac{1}{x}\"></span>  сдви­гом на еди­ни­цу впра­во, от­ра­же­ни­ем от­но­си­тель­но оси абс­цисс и рас­тя­же­ни­ем в три раза вдоль оси ор­ди­нат. Сле­до­ва­тель­но, <span data-inline-latex=\"a=-1\"></span>, <span data-inline-latex=\"k=-3\"></span>, от­ку­да <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=-\\frac{3}{x-1}.\"></span> </p><p>Решим урав­не­ние:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3}{x-1}=0{,}15\\Leftrightarrow\\frac{1}{x-1}=-\\frac{5}{100}\\Leftrightarrow\\frac{1}{x-1}=-\\frac{1}{20}\\Leftrightarrow x-1=-20\\Leftrightarrow x=-19.\"></span></span></p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": []}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_5"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_6"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:46:23.543273+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_7"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/8d95aee9-0837-4e77-9d7f-eb812f0e541c\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции вида <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x+a}\"></span> .  Най­ди­те зна­че­ние <i>x</i>, при ко­то­ром <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=0{,}15\"></span>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-19</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p>Гра­фик функ­ции <i>f</i> по­лу­чен из гра­фи­ка <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\frac{1}{x}\"></span>  сдви­гом на еди­ни­цу впра­во, от­ра­же­ни­ем от­но­си­тель­но оси абс­цисс и рас­тя­же­ни­ем в три раза вдоль оси ор­ди­нат. Сле­до­ва­тель­но, <span data-inline-latex=\"a=-1\"></span>, <span data-inline-latex=\"k=-3\"></span>, от­ку­да <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=-\\frac{3}{x-1}.\"></span> </p><p>Решим урав­не­ние:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3}{x-1}=0{,}15\\Leftrightarrow\\frac{1}{x-1}=-\\frac{5}{100}\\Leftrightarrow\\frac{1}{x-1}=-\\frac{1}{20}\\Leftrightarrow x-1=-20\\Leftrightarrow x=-19.\"></span></span></p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}